[{:adr/consequences "{:canvas_followup \"club-shinshi canvas 準備項目 'PSP/crypto rail 解禁' now references\\n                    kotoba-lang/pay + JK株式会社 — update via gftd canvas note (generated\\n                    md not hand-edited)\", :crossover_review_moot \"ADR-2607071000's pending etzhayyim-side crossover review is no\\n                          longer needed (the crossover no longer exists)\", :followups [\"Superfluid / 0xSplits / Safe-escrow PayRail adapters\" \"first consumer wiring: club-shinshi tip with treasury verification feeding\\n               entitle\" \"consider neutral NSID for the monetization capability lexicon\" \"deps wiring in jk-luxury/club-shinshi and jk-luxury/net-babiniku\"], :out_of_scope \"@etzhayyim/sdk non-payment surfaces (atproto/encrypted/ipfs/...) stay\\n                 etzhayyim-internal\"}", :adr/authoritative_for ["settlement/operating entity for club-shinshi and net-babiniku creator monetization\n    (tip/subscribe/PPV) = JK株式会社 ('Shinshi Inc.', GitHub org jk-luxury) — etzhayyim is\n    not involved and keeps its donation-only rail unchanged" "the payment surface of @etzhayyim/sdk (pay.ts: pay/payStream/splitDistribute/escrow)\n    is re-homed as the vendor-neutral common library kotoba-lang/pay (pure .cljc, zero\n    network I/O, zero key custody, PayRail protocol seam, unprovisioned-rail honest default,\n    entitle = verify-before-honor)" "supersession of ADR-2607071000 Decision #1 (vendor consumes etzhayyim rail) and\n    Decision #4 (vendor->etzhayyim crossover proposal); its lexicon shape, client-side\n    signing, and verify-before-honor invariants are retained"], :adr/supersedes ["adr-2607071000 (Decision #1 and #4 only)"], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607071000-net-babiniku-crypto-payment-rail-etzhayyim-consumption.md" "90-docs/adr/2607062200-net-babiniku-onlyfans-style-creator-monetization.md" "90-docs/adr/2607062300-jk-luxury-org-club-shinshi-net-babiniku-relocation.md" "90-docs/adr/2607051621-treasury-extraction.md" "90-docs/adr/2605220000-shinshi-psp-freeze.md"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607092700-shinshi-inc-settlement-kotoba-lang-pay", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-09", :adr/decision "{:operator \"JK株式会社 ('Shinshi Inc.', org jk-luxury) owns creator-monetization\\n             settlement, platform take (20% of 80/20), and PSP/AML/regulatory posture\\n             for club-shinshi + net-babiniku; etzhayyim uninvolved\", :new_repo \"kotoba-lang/pay\", :library {:layer_contract \"pure .cljc, zero network I/O, zero key custody — same as\\n                    kotoba-lang/base-l2 and treasury\", :pure [\"parse-usdc / format-usdc (6-decimal micros, truncating parse)\" \"flow-rate-per-second (Superfluid-shaped)\" \"split-allocations / creator-platform-split (80/20, dust to creator,\\n           total invariant)\" \"capability-errors / valid-capability? / expired? (generalized\\n           net.babiniku.monetization.capability shape)\" \"->receipt (string micros on the wire)\" \"entitle = verify-before-honor decision (grant only on host-verified\\n           settlement covering the authorized amount)\"], :seam \"PayRail protocol (-pay! -pay-stream! -pay-stream-stop! -split-distribute!\\n          -escrow-open! -escrow-release!) — hosts back with base-l2 (transfer/ERC-4337),\\n          treasury (verification), wallet (signing)\", :honest_default \"unprovisioned-rail HOLDs every operation with\\n                    :pay/unprovisioned-capability — never fake a settlement\", :verified \"7 tests / 49 assertions green (clojure -M:test), clj-kondo errors 0\"}, :chain_stack_unchanged \"Base L2 / USDC・EURC・JPYC / passkey smart wallet /\\n                          payer-device signing / no platform-held private key —\\n                          the operator and code home change, not the cryptographic rail\", :economic_gate_update \"reverse-toposort B3 gate (creator-monetization unlock) moves\\n                         from 'etzhayyim review + SDK stub implementation' to\\n                         'kotoba-lang/pay rail adapters + treasury verification wiring',\\n                         fully owned on the Shinshi Inc side; ignition order unchanged:\\n                         shinshi tip -> babiniku tip/subscribe -> GMV demand into\\n                         murakumo/net-kotobase -> kotoba/kotobase identity layer\"}", :db/id -1, :adr/problem "{:source \"owner directive 2026-07-09: 'club-shinshi は etzhayyim じゃなくて shinshi inc\\n           にして。@etzhayyim/sdk は kotoba-lang repo で共通ライブラリにしなおして'\", :investigated [\"etzhayyim substrate boundary (orgs/etzhayyim/root/CLAUDE.md) prohibits external\\n    tip/subscription/purchase payment purposes — creator monetization was doctrinally\\n    incompatible with consuming etzhayyim's rail from the start\" \"vendor->etzhayyim consumption crossover had no worked example in ADR-2605211950 and\\n    was blocked on etzhayyim-side review\" \"@etzhayyim/sdk implementation state: only pay() real; payStream/splitDistribute/\\n    verify() are stubs; missing verify() alone forces HARD-hold on every entitlement\" \"relocation precedent + building blocks already in kotoba-lang: base-l2 (relocated\\n    from etzhayyim-sdk per ADR-2607011940), treasury (USDC on-chain verification +\\n    ledger = the verify() shape), wallet (non-custodial signing), kessai (fiat ISO\\n    sibling)\" \"club-shinshi/net-babiniku already transferred to jk-luxury (JK株式会社) 2026-07-06\\n    per ADR-2607062300 — the corporate vessel exists\"], :risk \"adult-business crypto settlement needs per-jurisdiction legal review (資金決済法/\\n         AML); this ADR moves the code home and the operating entity, it does not clear\\n         legal gates\"}", :adr/alternatives "[{:option \"keep ADR-2607071000's design (vendor consumes etzhayyim rail)\", :rejected_because \"doctrinally incompatible (etzhayyim prohibits external\\n                      tip/subscription/purchase) and organizationally blocked\\n                      (unreviewed crossover, unimplemented stubs)\"} {:option \"fold the surface into kotoba-lang/treasury or kessai instead of a new repo\", :rejected_because \"treasury is quote/verify/ledger and kessai is fiat ISO rails —\\n                      both are composed BY pay, not homes for the creator-rail surface;\\n                      a focused repo keeps the layer boundaries legible\"} {:option \"port the TS SDK as-is (viem, key-holding PayClient)\", :rejected_because \"violates the kotoba-lang layer contract (zero vendor SDK, zero\\n                      custody) and the repo-wide runtime priority (.cljc first);\\n                      the EOA privateKey PayClient also contradicted the no-server-key\\n                      invariant the SDK itself stated\"}]", :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "ADR-2607092700: club-shinshi/net-babiniku settlement operator = Shinshi Inc (JK株式会社), @etzhayyim/sdk payment surface re-homed as kotoba-lang/pay"}]